title: $:/plugins/mblackman/tiddlypwa/sync-status

<$reveal type="match" state="$:/status/TiddlyPWASyncState" text="error">
<div class="tiddlypwa-form-error">
	<strong>Last sync failed:</strong> {{$:/status/TiddlyPWALastSyncError}}
	<$reveal type="nomatch" state="$:/status/TiddlyPWASyncing" text="yes">
		<$button message="tiddlypwa-sync">Retry now</$button>
	</$reveal>
</div>
</$reveal>

<$reveal type="match" state="$:/status/TiddlyPWASyncState" text="offline">
<p><strong>Status: Offline</strong> - changes are saved locally in IndexedDB until you reconnect.</p>
</$reveal>

<$reveal type="match" state="$:/status/TiddlyPWASyncState" text="dirty">
<p><strong>Status: Unsynced changes pending</strong> ({{$:/status/TiddlyPWAUnsyncedCount}}).</p>
</$reveal>

<$reveal type="match" state="$:/status/TiddlyPWASyncState" text="synced">
<p><strong>Status: Up to date</strong> - all changes are saved and synced.</p>
</$reveal>

<$reveal type="nomatch" state="$:/status/TiddlyPWASyncing" text="yes">
<$button message="tiddlypwa-sync">Sync now</$button>
</$reveal>

<$reveal type="match" state="$:/status/TiddlyPWASyncing" text="yes">
''Currently syncing'' with {{$:/status/TiddlyPWASyncingWith}}, <$button message="tiddlypwa-sync-cancel">cancel</$button>?
</$reveal>

<details>
<summary>Advanced options…</summary>
<p>If there are somehow changes that aren't being saved on the server, you can try to <$button message="tiddlypwa-sync-all">sync with all contents</$button>.</p>
<p>Live updates status: {{$:/status/TiddlyPWARealtime}}.</p>
</details>
